   "widgets_values": [
    "## Verboa Video: image to video\n1. Choose your first frame in **Load First Frame** (a camera-facing frame with the whole scene in view animates best).\n2. Say what moves in the **prompt** of Verboa Video (who, how, the camera, the sounds).\n3. Press Run. The mp4 lands in `output/video`, the strip below shows five frames so you can check the face stays the same before you post.\nNeeds the five LTX-2.5 files listed in the README (open *Advanced* on the node to pick them)."
